Package: carryover
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Carryover Authors <authors@carryover.dev>
Depends: ca-certificates, restic, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: xdg-utils
Description: Linux OS Migration Application
 Carryover helps users switch Linux distributions without losing personal data.
 Backs up personal files, configs, apps, and developer project rebuild recipes.
 Includes native GTK4/Adwaita desktop UI, cross-distro package mapping, and restic encrypted backup.
